            </note>
            <note corresp="#d72-f3" n="3" xml:id="d72-f3-content">
                <p>The details of the New Economic Policy President Nixon announced on August 15 had been worked out in meetings of
                    the President with his key economic advisers at Camp David August 13-15; see
                        <ref target="#d168">Document 168</ref>.</p>
            </note>
